From 1515151515151515151515151515151515151515 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 04:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/15] soc: mediatek: pm-domains: Add MT6789 power domains and panfrost support

Add support for MediaTek MT6789 (Helio G99) power domains to the
mtk-pm-domains driver and register mediatek,mt6789-mali in Panfrost.

On MT6789, the Mali-G57 MC2 GPU uses power domains MFG0-MFG3:
- MFG0 (0x308): top-level MFG domain
- MFG1 (0x30c): parent domain with 4-step AXI bus protection
- MFG2 (0x310): shader core 0
- MFG3 (0x314): shader core 1

Register bus protection definitions and domain data, add DT bindings,
and wire Panfrost device table for mediatek,mt6789-mali matching
mediatek_mt8186_data (2 power domains: core0, core1).

Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <324514544+sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
